          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "సైన్యం (sainyaṁ) is borrowed from Sanskrit sainya, \"belonging to an army; an army\" (CDIAL 13602), built on senā, \"an army\"."
            }
          ]
        },
