          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "సైనికుడు (sainikuḍu) is borrowed from Sanskrit sainika, \"a soldier, a man of the army\" (Monier-Williams), with the Telugu ending -uḍu."
            }
