              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "దండెత్తు (daṇḍettu) is a native compound: daṇḍu, \"an army, a host\" (DEDR 3055), and ettu, \"to lift, raise; to set out\" (DEDR 796): to raise an army against someone."
            }
